<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>ASUNCION CHESS 3D</strong></p>
<p>Last updated: November 5, 2026</p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
ASUNCION CHESS 3D is a chess game that allows players to enjoy
chess gameplay and challenge an AI opponent. This Privacy Policy
explains how information may be handled when you use the app.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>
The app is designed to provide chess gameplay. We do not intentionally
ask users to provide sensitive personal information through the game.
Depending on the features and platform used, technical information
may be processed by the hosting provider or platform.
</p>

<h2>3. How Information Is Used</h2>
<p>
Information, if processed, may be used to operate the app, maintain
security, troubleshoot technical issues, and improve the user experience.
</p>

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>
The app may be accessed through Pi Browser or hosted using GitHub Pages.
Those services may process information under their own privacy policies.
Please review the privacy policies of the relevant service providers.
</p>

<h2>5. Data Security</h2>
<p>
Reasonable steps are taken to keep the app and its information secure.
However, no method of online transmission or electronic storage is
guaranteed to be completely secure.
</p>

<h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>
The app is not intended to knowingly collect personal information
from children. If you believe personal information has been submitted
through the app, please contact the developer.
</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated as the app changes.
The latest version will be published on this page.
</p>

<h2>8. Contact</h2>
